  "comment": "The offline zones of OffTrack: one line per zone, with its extract on Geofabrik and whether speed cameras may be shown there. ban lists the French departments whose house numbers come from the Base Adresse Nationale; prove are searches printed in the log of every build, to check the search index by eye. To add a zone, add a line: the next run of the Zone offline action builds it. A country Geofabrik publishes only with its neighbours takes the larger extract and \"boundary\", the id of its border relation on OpenStreetMap: the action cuts the extract to it. The common Valhalla build reads the extracts of valhalla_sources, which must cover every zone (with the same boundary where there is one).",
